                  "fill": "$te-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "every panel and dialog already uses the one grey scrim #767676 at 60 %. bottom panels (id help, filters, new chat, send a record, audio quality, help panels) share the 2 px ink top edge, close × top right, and a full-width key at the bottom. audio quality: the “sound settings →” link became a full-width key.",
