                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "downloads “completed” was green (green = online only): now an ink square and an ink progress bar. the “claimed” toast square was orange (orange = playing): now blue (info). the platter-occupied toast is red (error). online green, offline hollow, downloading orange, paused amber: already correct.",
